# ---- Xcode project ----
# TextMate.xcodeproj is COMMITTED (Phase 2 Task 7): project.yml stays the
# source of truth, but contributors need only Xcode, not XcodeGen, to build.
# Regenerate on demand with `xcodegen generate --spec project.yml` after
# editing project.yml. xcuserdata/*.xcuserstate below still ignore the
# per-user state XcodeGen writes inside it on every `xcodegen generate` and
# every `open TextMate.xcodeproj`. Xcode/generated/ is XcodeGen's own
# `entitlements:` plist output (TextMate.entitlements, written fresh on
# every `xcodegen generate`, same lifecycle as the .xcodeproj itself -- not
# the app's real, committed Applications/TextMate/Entitlements.plist source).
Xcode/generated/

